#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:60
#, no-c-format
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "Uvod"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:62
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&choqok; is a micro-blogging client which currently supports Pump.io, GNU "
"social and Twitter.com services."
msgstr ""
"&choqok; je mikro-blogerski klijent koji trenutno podržava Identi.ca/"
"Laconica i Twitter.com usluge."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:64
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Micro-blogging is a form of multimedia blogging that allows users to send "
"brief text updates or micro media such as photos or audio clips and publish "
"them. These can be viewed either by anyone or by a restricted group, which "
"can be decided by the user. These messages can be submitted by a variety of "
"means, including text messaging, instant messaging, email, digital audio or "
"the web."
msgstr ""
"Mikro-blogiranje je oblik blogiranja koje korisniku dozvoljava da pošalje "
"kratke tekstualne izmjene ili mikro medije poput slika ili audio klipova i "
"objavi ih. To može biti dostupno za pregled ili svima ili određenoj grupi, "
"što odlučuje korisnik. Ove poruke mogu biti podnijete na mnogo različitih "
"načina, uključujući tekstualne poruke, instant messaging, email, digitalni "
"audio ili web."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:73
#, no-c-format
msgid "Using &choqok;"
msgstr "Korištenje &choqok;"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:76
#, no-c-format
msgid "Getting Started"
msgstr "Započinjanje"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:78
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In the &choqok; main window there are some timelines allowing you to see "
"what your friends have posted, replies to them and direct messages sent and "
"received from friends. You can also post a new message."
msgstr ""
"U &choqok; glavnom prozoru postoje vremenske crte koje vam dozvoljavaju da "
"vidite šta su vaši prijatelji postavili, odgovore na njih i lične poruke "
"poslate i primljene od prijatelja. Također, možete postaviti i novu poruku."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:82
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"All of this will be available when you configure at least one account in "
"&choqok;."
msgstr ""
"Sve ovo će biti dostupno nakon što konfigurišete barem jedan račun u "
"&choqok;."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:86
#, no-c-format
msgid "Here is a screenshot of the &choqok; main window"
msgstr "Ovdje je snimak ekrana &choqok; glavnog prozora"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:92
#, no-c-format
msgid "&choqok; main window"
msgstr "&choqok; glavni prozor"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:97
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You have one tab per account, on the screenshot you can see a tab with the "
"alias <guilabel>Pump.io</guilabel> and another with the alias "
"<guilabel>twitter</guilabel>."
msgstr ""
"Imate jedan tab za jedan račun, na snimku ekrana možete vidjeti tab sa "
"nazivom <guilabel>identica</guilabel> i još jedan sa nazivom "
"<guilabel>twitter</guilabel>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:101
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"On top of the tab you can choose to send a direct message to someone who is "
"subscribed to your account. You can send direct messages to other users of "
"the same service, as long as both of you are subscribed to each other. If "
"you leave <guilabel>Direct message to</guilabel> unchecked your message will "
"be posted publicly and all your friends will read it. If you check it, you "
"will then choose a name in the list and the private message will only be "
"posted to this person."
msgstr ""
"Na vrhu taba možete izabrati da pošaljete privatnu poruku nekome ko je "
"pretplaćen na vaš račun. Možete slati privatne poruke drugim korisnicima "
"istog servisa sve dok ste jedno drugom pretplatnici. Ako ostavite "
"<guilabel>Privatna poruka za</guilabel> nečekirano, vaša poruka će biti "
"postavljena javno i svi vaši prijatelji će je moći pročitati. Ako je "
"čekirate, nakon toga ćete izabrati ime iz liste i vaša poruka će biti "
"vidljiva samo toj osobi."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:109
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The text area allows you to post your message which must have less than 140 "
"characters. The number of characters left is displayed in green on bottom "
"right under the text area. The color changes to orange when you reach the 30 "
"characters limit then to red when you reach 0. If your message is longer "
"than 140 characters, you will be asked if you want to post it anyway. If you "
"agree, it will be posted up to 140 characters."
msgstr ""
"Tekstualna oblast vam dozvoljava da postavite poruku koja mora sadržati "
"manje od 140 znakova. Preostali broj znakova je prikazan zelenom bojom u "
"donjem desnom dijelu ispod tekstualne oblast. Boja se mijenja u narandžastu "
"kada prijeđete ograničenje od 30 znakova, a onda u crvenu kada broj "
"preostalih znakova postane 0 .Ako je vaša poruka duža od 140 znakova bit "
"ćete pitani da li želite da je postavite uprkos tome što prelazi limit. Ako "
"prihvatite, bit će postavljena do 140 znakova."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:116
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>Home</guilabel> tab displays the timeline which consists in "
"all posts you and your friends wrote. A post using Pump.io is called a post "
"while a post using Twitter is called a tweet."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Početni</guilabel> prikazuje vremenske crte koje se sastoje od "
"objava koje ste vi i vaši prijatelji pisali. Objava koji koristi Identi.ca "
"se naziva dent, dok se post koji koristi Twitter naziva tweet."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:120
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>Reply</guilabel> tab displays posts that are replies to you."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Odgovori</guilabel> tab prikazuje postove koji su odgovori vama."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:123
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"All the private messages you sent will be displayed in the <guilabel>Outbox</"
"guilabel> tab while the received ones will be displayed in the "
"<guilabel>Inbox tab</guilabel>."
msgstr ""
"Sve privatne poruke koje pošaljete će biti prikazane u <guilabel>Poslato</"
"guilabel> tabu, dok će primljene biti prikazane u <guilabel>Primljeno tabu</"
"guilabel>."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:130
#, no-c-format
msgid "Searching"
msgstr "Pretraživanje"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:132
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can search through services for something (anything that the service-"
"search API can offer to a client)."
msgstr ""
"Možete pretraživati kroz usluge za nečim (bilo šta što API pretraživanje "
"usluga može ponuditi klijentu)."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:135
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This function is available via the <menuchoice><guimenu>Tools</guimenu> "
"<guimenuitem>Search</guimenuitem> </menuchoice> menu (shortcut: <keycombo "
"action=\"simul\">&Ctrl; <keycap>F</keycap></keycombo>) For example you can "
"search for a special word in all users' posts:"
msgstr ""
"Ova funkcija je dostupna kroz <menuchoice><guimenu>Alati</guimenu> "
"<guimenuitem>Traži</guimenuitem> </menuchoice> meni (prečica: <keycombo "
"action=\"simul\">&Ctrl; <keycap>F</keycap></keycombo>) Na primjer, možete "
"tražiti određenu riječ u postovima svih korisnika:"

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:142
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>&choqok; search feature</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>&choqok; mogućnost pretraživanja</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:148
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>&choqok; search feature</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>&choqok; mogućnost pretraživanja</phrase>"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:156
#, no-c-format
msgid "Configuring an Account"
msgstr "Konfigurisanje računa"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:158
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Open the &choqok; configuration window via <menuchoice><guimenu>Settings</"
"guimenu> <guimenuitem>Configure &choqok;...</guimenuitem> </menuchoice> then "
"go to the <guilabel>Accounts</guilabel> tab and click the <guibutton>Add</"
"guibutton> button, the <guilabel>Add a new account</guilabel> window will "
"appear."
msgstr ""
"Otvorite &choqok; konfiguracijski prozor kroz <menuchoice><guimenu>Postavke</"
"guimenu> <guimenuitem>Konfiguriši &choqok;...</guimenuitem> </menuchoice> "
"onda idite na <guilabel>Računi</guilabel> tab i kliknite na "
"<guibutton>Dodaj</guibutton> dugme,  <guilabel>Dodaj novi račun</guilabel> "
"prozor će se pojaviti."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:166
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>Adding an account</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>Dodavanje računa</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:172
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Adding an account</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Dodavanje računa</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:177
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Simply enter your desired unique alias, username and password and click the "
"<guibutton>OK</guibutton> button. This will check your credentials and, if "
"everything is okay, your account will be ready to use."
msgstr ""
"Unesite željeni naziv, ime i šifru i kliknite na <guibutton>OK</guibutton> "
"dugme. Ovo će provjeriti vaše podatke i, ako je sve ispravno, vas račun će "
"biti napravljen i spreman za upotrebu."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:180
#, no-c-format
msgid "You can configure other accounts subsequently."
msgstr "Nakon toga možete konfigurisati druge račune."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:184
#, no-c-format
msgid "Special Features"
msgstr "Posebne mogućnosti"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:187
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can disable the timeline updating of &choqok; (the timeline is the list "
"of posts by you and your friends)."
msgstr ""
"Možete isključiti ažuriranje vremenskih crta &choqok; (vremenska crta je "
"lista vaših i objava vaših prijatelja)."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:191
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Another special feature is the ability to notify the user about new received "
"posts."
msgstr ""
"Još jedna posebna mogućnost je obavještavanje korisnika o novim objavama."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:195
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can do a quick post by pressing <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl; "
"<keycap>T</keycap></keycombo> to open the quick micro-blog window and write "
"your post:"
msgstr ""
"Možete brzo napraviti objavu pritiskanjem <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl; "
"<keycap>T</keycap></keycombo> da otvorite brzi mikro-blog i napišete vašu "
"objavu:"

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:201
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>Quick posting dialog</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>Brza objava</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:207
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Quick posting dialog</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Brza objava</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:211
#, no-c-format
msgid "You can post the same text to all accounts at once."
msgstr "Možete objaviti isti tekst svim korisnicima odjednom."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:213
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When new posts are received, &choqok; marks them as unread and shows the "
"number of unread posts in the system tray icon. When the main window is "
"shown and then minimized to system tray it then marks all new messages as "
"read."
msgstr ""
"Kada su nove objave primljene, &choqok; ih označi kao nepročitane i pokazuje "
"broj nepročitanih objava u ikoni sistemskog poslužnika. Kada je glavni "
"prozor prikazan, a nakon toga minimiziran u sistemski poslužnik, on označava "
"sve nove objave kao pročitane."

